OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 19, dies after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man has died after a car
OL,7,Fcrashed into a tree in Bolton, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FThe Toyota Yaris appeared to lose
OL,11,Fcontrol on Radcliffe Road shortly
OL,12,Fbefore 23:00 BST on Friday, Greater
OL,13,FManchester Police said.
OL,15,FFour people were inside the vehicle,
OL,16,Fwith the force initially describing
OL,17,Fsome of their injuries as
OL,18,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
